-- Kept on ASSUME deliberately (IMPLICIT-PROPS-DESIGN.md §11.1, R0: ASSUME is deprecated): every declaration here is an ASSUME signature in one of its spellings, and the spellings are the subject.

§ `Signatures`
    GIVEN g IS A T OF NUMBER

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
      b IS A TYPE
GIVETH A TYPE
DECLARE Pair
  HAS `first component`  IS AN a
      `second component` IS A b

GIVEN x IS A BOOLEAN
ASSUME f x IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN x IS A TYPE
ASSUME T x IS A TYPE

GIVEN x IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
ASSUME h

#CHECK f
#CHECK g
#CHECK h
